            "q": "What should I pack for a winter Spiti trip?",
            "a": "You must carry:\n\n- Heavy woolens & thermal layers\n- Down jacket, gloves, woolen socks & cap\n- Waterproof shoes\n- Personal medicines & essentials\n\nPacking right is crucial due to extreme cold conditions."
