          "q": "When is the best time to take this Spiti Valley tour?",
          "a": "Honestly, it depends on what you want to experience.\n\n- Snow? **Feb–March** (timing varies, check before planning)\n- Holi & festivals? **March / June–August**\n- Chandratal Lake? **June–September only**\n- Best overall weather? **June–September**\n- Stargazing & “naked sky”? **Late September–October**\n\nNo one “best” time just the best time for your kind of Spiti."
