      "overviewText": "If you’ve been searching for a raw and real **[Winter Spiti experience](https://indiatour.live/spiti-valley)**, then this is the adventure you’ve been waiting for.\n\nIndia Tour Experiences brings you a **7 Days / 6 Nights Winter Spiti 4x4 Expedition** designed specially for travelers who want to experience Spiti in its rawest, snow-covered form — safely, comfortably, and with expert trip leaders.\n\nThis is not a regular road trip. This is a **true winter expedition**, powered by **4x4 vehicles (Jimny)**, covering frozen rivers, high-altitude villages, ancient monasteries, and some of the most dramatic Himalayan landscapes.\n\nIf you’re dreaming of a real Himalayan winter adventure, this **Winter Spiti 4x4 Expedition** is your calling.\n\nJoin the ultimate [Spiti Trip by India Tour Experiences](https://indiatour.live/tours/spiti-valley-road-trip)\n\n### Our **Winter Spiti 4x4 Expedition** is crafted for travelers who want:\n\n- Real Himalayan winter driving in **4x4 vehicles**\n- Snow landscapes without compromising on safety\n- Cozy homestays in remote villages\n- Authentic Spitian culture\n- A guided group experience with backup oxygen & first aid\n\nExplore [Winter Spiti Road Trip](https://indiatour.live/tours/winter-spiti-road-trip) here!\n\n### Highlights of the **Winter Spiti 4x4 Expedition**\n\n- Exploring India’s last village near the Indo-Tibet border, Chitkul\n- Visiting the ancient [Dhankar Monastery](https://indiatour.live/attractions/dhankar-monastery)\n- Walking across Asia’s highest suspension bridge, [Chicham Bridge](https://indiatour.live/attractions/chicham-bridge)\n- Seeking blessings at [Key Monastery](https://indiatour.live/attractions/key-monastery)\n- Standing at the world-famous post office in [Hikkim](https://indiatour.live/attractions/hikkim)\n- Driving through high-altitude villages like [Komic](https://indiatour.live/attractions/komic) and Langza\n- Witnessing frozen beauty near [Nako Lake](https://indiatour.live/attractions/nako)",
